  "additional": {
    "aboutAssay": "",
    "forReview": "The kit is functional as the standard curve looks good and is within the expected range. However, there is a clear matrix effect in the sample. In regular serum sample nothing is detected except 1:64 dilution. On the other hand,  in the ethanol-extracted samples, it looks the conc are increased with the dilution. Lower dilutions were affected by matrix interference, while higher dilutions resulted in signals below the kit’s detection limit."
  },
